Kaelor Windforge is a character from the popular online role-playing game World of Warcraft. He is a Neutral-level 70 Draenei Mage who serves as an NPC (non-player character) in the game's world of Azeroth.

 Specifically, he can be found in Dalaran, the floating city above Northrend, where he operates a forge that allows produces various Draenei artifacts. He is known for his expertise in creating Windforges, which are powerful magical devices that can channel the power of the wind to create beneficial effects or even create temporary flight.

 Windforges are significant items in the lore because they are one of the few means by which the draenei can fly, as they do not have natural wings like other flying races such as the Kal'Dorei (Elves). The Windforger itself is a device that channels the Draenei's connection to the Naaru ( their divine essence ) to create this effect.

